      "key": "draft-followup",
      "label": "Draft a follow-up message",
      "body": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-crm` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then draft the follow-up I ask for as `suggested-reply` with status \"needs_review\", a clear `reason`, and any risk badges. This only drafts the message \u2014 it never sends it; sending happens through another skill only after I approve it here."
